  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A short report on potential green market in Vietnam as a background information to Team Vietnam member in H&#xe5;nosand workshop as well as an input for developing Center&apos;s Business Plan. It is 20 pages in Vietnamese version written by Vietnam Academy of Science and Technology need to be translated into English and sharing to Team Vietnam.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En kort rapport om den potentiella gr&#xf6;na marknaden i Vietnam, som en bakgrundsinformation till Team Vietnam medlemmar i H&#xe4;rn&#xf6;sands workshop samt en ing&#xe5;ng f&#xf6;r att utveckla Centrets aff&#xe4;rsplan. Det &#xe4;r 20 sidor vietnamesisk version skriven av Vietnam Academy of Science and Technology , m&#xe5;ste &#xf6;vers&#xe4;ttas till engelska och d&#xe4;refter delad med Team Vietnam.</narrative>
  </description>
